# Security headers for static-asset responses.
# Applied by the Workers static-assets layer (file lives in the assets
# directory, copied from public/ into dist/ at build time) and understood by
# the existing Cloudflare Pages deployment, so both delivery paths stay
# covered. Content-Security-Policy is intentionally NOT set here: the app
# emits dynamic inline styles and a CSP would require an application-level
# audit before it can be added safely.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: document-domain=()